    {
      "title": "Version 1.53.0",
      "updated": "2026-08-22T19:38:06Z",
      "url": "https://github.com/Acly/krita-ai-diffusion/releases/tag/v1.53.0",
      "notes_html": "<h2><a href=\"https://github.com/Acly/krita-ai-diffusion/releases/download/v1.53.0/krita_ai_diffusion-1.53.0.zip\">Download krita_ai_diffusion-1.53.0.zip</a></h2>\n<p><strong>For Krita 5</strong> (recommended: Krita 5.3.2.1)</p>\n<h2>Anima Segmentation Control</h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://huggingface.co/Sen-sou/Anima-LLLite-Regional-Controlnet\" rel=\"nofollow\">Segmentation control layer</a> is now supported for Anima (PR by <a class=\"user-mention notranslate\" data-hovercard-type=\"user\" data-hovercard-url=\"/users/Sen-sou/hovercard\" data-octo-click=\"hovercard-link-click\" data-octo-dimensions=\"link_type:self\" href=\"https://github.com/Sen-sou\">@Sen-sou</a>).</p>\n<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/6485914/639926509-3252c759-597f-40de-b643-23e51df198a0.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..Si75sLxO6mBZpRyBNdRk6tps-LTnc13a8YISYwKH99g\"><img width=\"880\" alt=\"release-1 53 0-segmentation\" src=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/6485914/639926509-3252c759-597f-40de-b643-23e51df198a0.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..Si75sLxO6mBZpRyBNdRk6tps-LTnc13a8YISYwKH99g\" content-type-secured-asset=\"image/png\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"></a>\n<p>Instructions:</p>\n<ol>\n<li>Download <a href=\"https://huggingface.co/Sen-sou/Anima-LLLite-Regional-Controlnet/resolve/main/anima-lllite-regional-exp-v3.safetensors\" rel=\"nofollow\">the model</a> and put it into <code>models/controlnet</code></li>\n<li>Create a Control Layer and select Segmentation mode</li>\n<li>(Optional) Create a segmentation image from your existing Regions with the <code>T</code> button</li>\n<li>Generate</li>\n</ol>\n<h2>Upgrades and Removals</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Upgraded managed server to CUDA 13, PyTorch 2.13 and latest ComfyUI</li>\n<li>Now supports int8 / int4 / ConvRot models <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"4810249715\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/Acly/krita-ai-diffusion/issues/2553\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/Acly/krita-ai-diffusion/issues/2553/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/Acly/krita-ai-diffusion/issues/2553\">#2553</a></li>\n<li>Removed Nunchaku support</li>\n<li>Removed insightface (used by SD1.5/SDXL Face-ID) from managed server install</li>\n</ul>\n<p>If you were using the Nunchaku variants of Flux 1, Flux 1 Kontext, Qwen or Z-Image you will have to redownload alternative versions of these models. See <a href=\"https://docs.interstice.cloud/models/?arch-flux=true&amp;arch-zimage=true&amp;arch-sdxl=false&amp;kind-checkpoint=true&amp;set-optional=true&amp;kind-ip_adapter=false&amp;kind-inpaint=false&amp;kind=model_patch=false&amp;kind-upscaler=false&amp;kind-clip_vision=false&amp;kind-controlnet=false&amp;kind-text_encoder=false&amp;kind-vae=false&amp;kind-lora=false#downloading-models\" rel=\"nofollow\">models</a> or use the Managed Server installation.</p>\n<h2>Cloud Changes</h2>\n<p>As an image generation service, Interstice.cloud complies with EU AI Act Transparency laws.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Images saved from the history now contain a metadata tag to identify them as AI generated</li>\n<li>Images contain an invisible watermark with a fixed tag that links them to the service (users from EU only)</li>\n</ul>\n<p><em>This does not affect local use!</em></p>\n<h2>Other Changes</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Fixed image history displaying timestamps in UTC instead of local timezone <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"4798319004\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/Acly/krita-ai-diffusion/issues/2551\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/Acly/krita-ai-diffusion/issues/2551/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/Acly/krita-ai-diffusion/issues/2551\">#2551</a></li>\n<li>New-lines are now preserved when importing prompts from PNG metadata (by <a class=\"user-mention notranslate\" data-hovercard-type=\"user\" data-hovercard-url=\"/users/amiiari/hovercard\" data-octo-click=\"hovercard-link-click\" data-octo-dimensions=\"link_type:self\" href=\"https://github.com/amiiari\">@amiiari</a>)</li>\n<li>Warn when there are duplicate parameter names in a custom workflow <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"5055220153\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/Acly/krita-ai-diffusion/issues/2581\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/Acly/krita-ai-diffusion/issues/2581/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/Acly/krita-ai-diffusion/issues/2581\">#2581</a></li>\n</ul>",
