      "notes_html": "<h2><a href=\"https://github.com/Acly/krita-ai-diffusion/releases/download/v1.52.0/krita_ai_diffusion-1.52.0.zip\">Download krita_ai_diffusion-1.52.0.zip</a></h2>\n<p><strong>For Krita 5</strong> (recommended: Krita 5.3.2.1)</p>\n<div class=\"markdown-alert markdown-alert-important\"><p class=\"markdown-alert-title\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-report mr-2\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M0 1.75C0 .784.784 0 1.75 0h12.5C15.216 0 16 .784 16 1.75v9.5A1.75 1.75 0 0 1 14.25 13H8.06l-2.573 2.573A1.458 1.458 0 0 1 3 14.543V13H1.75A1.75 1.75 0 0 1 0 11.25Zm1.75-.25a.25.25 0 0 0-.25.25v9.5c0 .138.112.25.25.25h2a.75.75 0 0 1 .75.75v2.19l2.72-2.72a.749.749 0 0 1 .53-.22h6.5a.25.25 0 0 0 .25-.25v-9.5a.25.25 0 0 0-.25-.25Zm7 2.25v2.5a.75.75 0 0 1-1.5 0v-2.5a.75.75 0 0 1 1.5 0ZM9 9a1 1 0 1 1-2 0 1 1 0 0 1 2 0Z\"></path></svg>Important</p>\n<p>Because auto-update was broken in the previous version, please <a href=\"https://docs.interstice.cloud/installation/#installing-the-plugin\" rel=\"nofollow\">download and install</a> this version manually.</p>\n</div>\n<h2>Changes</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Basic support for Krea 2 model, see <a href=\"https://github.com/Acly/krita-ai-diffusion/discussions/2547\" data-hovercard-type=\"discussion\" data-hovercard-url=\"/Acly/krita-ai-diffusion/discussions/2547/hovercard\">discussion</a> (<a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"4731545508\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/Acly/krita-ai-diffusion/issues/2541\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/Acly/krita-ai-diffusion/pull/2541/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/Acly/krita-ai-diffusion/pull/2541\">#2541</a> by <a class=\"user-mention notranslate\" data-hovercard-type=\"user\" data-hovercard-url=\"/users/fukc-gihtub/hovercard\" data-octo-click=\"hovercard-link-click\" data-octo-dimensions=\"link_type:self\" href=\"https://github.com/fukc-gihtub\">@fukc-gihtub</a>)</li>\n<li>Region support for Anima (<a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"4400438295\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/Acly/krita-ai-diffusion/issues/2480\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/Acly/krita-ai-diffusion/issues/2480/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/Acly/krita-ai-diffusion/issues/2480\">#2480</a> by <a class=\"user-mention notranslate\" data-hovercard-type=\"user\" data-hovercard-url=\"/users/Sen-sou/hovercard\" data-octo-click=\"hovercard-link-click\" data-octo-dimensions=\"link_type:self\" href=\"https://github.com/Sen-sou\">@Sen-sou</a>)</li>\n<li>Fixed auto-updates installing to the wrong folder <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"4668172315\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/Acly/krita-ai-diffusion/issues/2533\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/Acly/krita-ai-diffusion/issues/2533/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/Acly/krita-ai-diffusion/issues/2533\">#2533</a></li>\n<li>Fixed model architecture not being set correctly from style in custom workflows (<a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"4659785080\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/Acly/krita-ai-diffusion/issues/2529\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/Acly/krita-ai-diffusion/pull/2529/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/Acly/krita-ai-diffusion/pull/2529\">#2529</a> by <a class=\"user-mention notranslate\" data-hovercard-type=\"user\" data-hovercard-url=\"/users/mtsmfm/hovercard\" data-octo-click=\"hovercard-link-click\" data-octo-dimensions=\"link_type:self\" href=\"https://github.com/mtsmfm\">@mtsmfm</a>)</li>\n<li>Increased maximum prompt text box size <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"4712225793\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/Acly/krita-ai-diffusion/issues/2538\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/Acly/krita-ai-diffusion/issues/2538/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/Acly/krita-ai-diffusion/issues/2538\">#2538</a></li>\n<li>Use edit mode for expanding images with Flux Klein 9B <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"4614975775\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/Acly/krita-ai-diffusion/issues/2518\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/Acly/krita-ai-diffusion/issues/2518/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/Acly/krita-ai-diffusion/issues/2518\">#2518</a></li>\n</ul>",
