    {
      "title": "Version 1.51.0",
      "updated": "2026-05-31T13:34:45Z",
      "url": "https://github.com/Acly/krita-ai-diffusion/releases/tag/v1.51.0",
      "notes_html": "<h2><a href=\"https://github.com/Acly/krita-ai-diffusion/releases/download/v1.51.0/krita_ai_diffusion-1.51.0.zip\">Download krita_ai_diffusion-1.51.0.zip</a></h2>\n<p><strong>For Krita 5</strong> (recommended: Krita 5.3.1)</p>\n<h2>Control layers for Anima</h2>\n<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/6485914/600600516-472aa378-9753-4c53-aa38-09c169e7969b.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..4AHwbme0_xNSzvuspb-BwZmMiu3nwkwPiWTV5kx-e6w\"><img width=\"1024\" height=\"558\" alt=\"release-1 51 0-anima-control\" src=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/6485914/600600516-472aa378-9753-4c53-aa38-09c169e7969b.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..4AHwbme0_xNSzvuspb-BwZmMiu3nwkwPiWTV5kx-e6w\" content-type-secured-asset=\"image/png\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; max-height: 558px;\"></a>\n<p>Supported control modes:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>for official v1.0: Scribble, Line Art, Unblur</li>\n<li>for old preview models: Depth, Pose</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Fill, Expand, etc. at full strength now <em>requires</em> the inpaint control model and gives much better results.</p>\n<p>Please check the <a href=\"https://github.com/Acly/krita-ai-diffusion/discussions/2477\" data-hovercard-type=\"discussion\" data-hovercard-url=\"/Acly/krita-ai-diffusion/discussions/2477/hovercard\">discussion</a> for model downloads! PR by <a class=\"user-mention notranslate\" data-hovercard-type=\"user\" data-hovercard-url=\"/users/Sen-sou/hovercard\" data-octo-click=\"hovercard-link-click\" data-octo-dimensions=\"link_type:self\" href=\"https://github.com/Sen-sou\">@Sen-sou</a></p>\n<h2>Other Changes</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Added ROCm as managed install option for supported AMD GPUs <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"2001686265\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/Acly/krita-ai-diffusion/issues/76\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/Acly/krita-ai-diffusion/issues/76/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/Acly/krita-ai-diffusion/issues/76\">#76</a> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3875639015\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/Acly/krita-ai-diffusion/issues/2315\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/Acly/krita-ai-diffusion/issues/2315/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/Acly/krita-ai-diffusion/issues/2315\">#2315</a> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"4463072812\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/Acly/krita-ai-diffusion/issues/2493\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/Acly/krita-ai-diffusion/issues/2493/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/Acly/krita-ai-diffusion/issues/2493\">#2493</a></li>\n<li>Fixed wrong assignments of <code>&lt;layer:name&gt;</code> references in prompts</li>\n<li>De-duplicate references to the same layer in more cases so they are only passed to the model once</li>\n<li>Fixed crash when a single-channel layer is used as input (eg. transparency mask) <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"4462798867\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/Acly/krita-ai-diffusion/issues/2492\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/Acly/krita-ai-diffusion/issues/2492/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/Acly/krita-ai-diffusion/issues/2492\">#2492</a></li>\n<li>Fixed the upscale strength slider being permanently disabled after selecting an edit model <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"4516859954\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/Acly/krita-ai-diffusion/issues/2499\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/Acly/krita-ai-diffusion/issues/2499/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/Acly/krita-ai-diffusion/issues/2499\">#2499</a></li>\n<li>Fixed issues when opening a document, especially with custom workflows <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"4395392213\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/Acly/krita-ai-diffusion/issues/2479\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/Acly/krita-ai-diffusion/pull/2479/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/Acly/krita-ai-diffusion/pull/2479\">#2479</a></li>\n<li>Changed color match functionality to detect when there is no color information outside the selection <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"4415995695\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/Acly/krita-ai-diffusion/issues/2483\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/Acly/krita-ai-diffusion/issues/2483/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/Acly/krita-ai-diffusion/issues/2483\">#2483</a></li>\n<li>Improved error message when trying to use reference layers in the prompt, but the model does not support them</li>\n<li>Improved file handling when come files are inaccessible (eg. access denied due to permissions)</li>\n</ul>",
